gh to just  work with Einstein's theory gravity you  also have to throw in quantum mechanics  into that and those are the two theories  we mentioned earlier don't get along so  you don't ultimately know so the way I  see it  is actually as an opportunity if we can  figure out what's going on with black  holes and they may even get some clues  by looking at them then that can  actually made it be the master key that  can help us unlock some of the deepest  mysteries of quantum gravity yes  yeah a unified theory of physics
 

